Z||000000||ChadMan||07-09-2001||03:31 PM||||OK, where can a fella go to get a really good nonabrasive wash mitt?  I have tried the best ones I can find at auto parts stores, but I'm still getting those super-fine spider-webby scratches in my finish.<P>Thanks in advance...||||reg||5
Z||000001||skitime||07-09-2001||04:29 PM||||The scratches are probably from the dirt that the mitt picks up.  It is nearly impossible to wash a car without causing some faint scratching unless the car was clean before.  Just my opinion. I have new paint and have been observing this too.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P7080039-2_2.jpg">  <BR> ||||reg||1
