Z||000003||rogergarrison||07-09-2001||06:42 PM||||Id say impossible to not get the fine scratches washing it. darker the color the worse it is. I use Turtle Wax Scratch n Swirl remover to take car of most of them for a wet look. Almost forgot......that is a gorgeous car dude.<p>[This message has been edited by rogergarrison (edited 07-09-2001).]||||reg||1
